 "sq": [
  {
   "_id": 18170,
   "ANSWER": "<p><br data-end=\"1427\" data-start=\"1424\" />\nThreads are needed for <strong data-end=\"1470\" data-start=\"1450\">faster execution</strong>, <strong data-end=\"1501\" data-start=\"1472\">efficient CPU utilization</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"1522\" data-start=\"1507\">parallelism</strong>. They allow a program to perform multiple tasks simultaneously while sharing memory and resources, which reduces context switching overhead compared to processes.</p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2",
    "PLO3"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"1412\" data-start=\"1353\"><strong data-end=\"1410\" data-start=\"1357\">Why are threads needed in an operating system?</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1685\" data-start=\"1413\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 205,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 18170
  },
  {
   "_id": 18171,
   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"1783\" data-start=\"1746\">A thread consists of:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"2085\" data-start=\"1784\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1821\" data-start=\"1784\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1821\" data-start=\"1786\"><strong data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1786\">Thread ID</strong> &ndash; Unique identifier</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1822\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1878\" data-start=\"1824\"><strong data-end=\"1843\" data-start=\"1824\">Program Counter</strong> &ndash; Points to the next instruction</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1879\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1927\" data-start=\"1881\"><strong data-end=\"1897\" data-start=\"1881\">Register Set</strong> &ndash; Holds CPU register values</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2085\" data-start=\"1928\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2085\" data-start=\"1930\"><strong data-end=\"1939\" data-start=\"1930\">Stack</strong> &ndash; Stores function calls, local variables<br data-end=\"1983\" data-start=\"1980\" />\n\tOther resources like code, data, and open files are <strong data-end=\"2045\" data-start=\"2035\">shared</strong> with other threads of the same process.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2",
    "PLO3"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"1745\" data-start=\"1692\"><strong data-end=\"1743\" data-start=\"1696\">What are the key components of a thread?</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1783\" data-start=\"1746\">\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b</p>\n",
